        "q": "What is the minimum order quantity (MOQ)?",
        "a": "Our MOQ varies by size and print type. For example, standard kraft paper bags with 1-color printing start at 500 pcs. Custom printed options may require higher MOQ."
      },
      {
        "q": "Can I customize the design or print on the bags?",
        "a": "Yes. We support 1-color, 2-color, and full-color custom printing. You can share your artwork or consult our in-house design team for assistance."
